        setup problem (missing API key, deepeval import failure, etc.)
    {\"skipped\": false, \"score\": 0.0-1.0, \"verdict\": \"grounded\"|
        \"ungrounded\", \"reason\": \"<judge's explanation>\"}             -- on a
