+         `IMPORTANT — Story ${child.id} is estimated at ~${Math.round(_est / 1000)}K tokens, ` +
+         `exceeding the ${Math.round(_tokenBudget / 1000)}K token budget. ` +
+         `It has ${(child.acceptanceCriteria || []).length} ACs. ` +
