+ ### Git diff since phase start ($phase_id)
+ $_spec_diff_stat
+
+ TypeScript/JSON changes (first 400 lines):
+ $_spec_diff_patch
+
+ ### Key implementation files (excerpts from technicalNotes.files)
+ $_spec_file_excerpts"
+         else
