+ ${ticketBlock || '- (no tickets available)'}
+
+ ${depBlock ? `WHAT THIS CODELINE DECLARES IT DEPENDS ON (from its own manifest — ground truth
+ about the stack, not inference from the ticket text). Where a ticket names a category
