+ plus that mode's own named field — there is no positional form:
+   EVERY call names the codeline it is about — the tool answers from THAT repository, and a
+   call that names none is refused when several are in scope, because answering from the
+   wrong one returns another repository's symbols as though they were this one's.
+   - codegraph_query(mode="explore", codeline="<name>", terms="<domain nouns from the ticket>")  — START HERE, per codeline
-   - codegraph_query query|callers|callees "<symbol>"          — trace what explore surfaced
-   - codegraph_query show "<file> [start] [end]"               — read the real lines before
+   - codegraph_query(mode="query", codeline="<name>", symbol="<SymbolName>")     — where a symbol is defined
+   - codegraph_query(mode="callers", codeline="<name>", symbol="<SymbolName>")   — who calls it
+   - codegraph_query(mode="callees", codeline="<name>", symbol="<SymbolName>")   — what it calls
+   - codegraph_query(mode="show", codeline="<name>", file="<path>")              — read the real lines before
-                                                                 quoting anything as evidence
+                                                                quoting anything as evidence
+
