+ same call again unchanged: the tool refuses an identical repeat, so a retry loop burns your
+ budget and returns nothing. If codegraph_query cannot be made to work at all, say so in your
+ evidence AND fall back to read_file and list_files rather than reporting a codeline you never
+ opened — a survey that examined nothing must never be the reason a team is assembled blind.
  It returns real symbols, their definition sites, who calls them, and which have tests. That is
